OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 FEB
OL,4,G1300FMusic Matters: The President and
OL,5,     Fthe Polka
OL,6,     GJustin Webb explores the
OL,7,     Grelationship between classical
OL,8,     Gmusic and American political
OL,9,     Ghistory. Today, music in the
OL,10,     Gservice of Cold War influence.
OL,11,G1400FRecord Review
OL,12,     GAndrew McGregor picks the best
OL,13,     Gnew classical releases, joined by
OL,14,     Gguests Cathy Newman and William
OL,15,     GMival, who recommends his
OL,16,     Gfavorite recording of Sibelius's
OL,17,     GSymphony No. 5.
