OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 FEB
OL,4,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,5,     GAriodante from the Royal Ballet
OL,6,     Gand Opera, the site of its
OL,7,     Gpremiere during Handel's first
OL,8,     GCovent Garden season in 1735.
OL,9,     GStarring Emily D'Angelo and
OL,10,     GJacquelyn Stucker.
OL,11,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,12,     GKathryn Tickell invites the Irish
OL,13,     Gvocal group Landless to paint a
OL,14,     Gsonic portrait of Dublin in three
OL,15,     Gtracks; and plays Congolese
OL,16,     Grumba, Catalan songs, and Greek-
OL,17,     GAnatolian laments.
OL,18,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,19,     GKate Molleson presents exclusive
OL,20,     Grecordings including Alex
OL,21,     GPaxton's Shrimp BIT Babyface.
OL,22,     GContains some strong language.
